{"ex-E101-1":{"id":"ex-E101-1","chapter":"E101","number":1,"title":"行星與太陽的距離","question":"<p>木星和土星這兩顆行星體積都很大，它們主要由氣體組成。</p><p>太陽</p><p>土星</p><p>9.5 AU 木星43.2 光分</p><p>(a) 光分是另一個長度單位，一光分指光在真空行進一分鐘的距離。</p><p>木星距離太陽約 43.2 光分。</p><p>(i) 光從太陽行進到至木星需時多久？</p><p>(ii) 試用米為單位表示太陽與木星之間的距離。</p><p>(b) 太陽和土星相距約 9.5 AU。</p><p>(i) 試用米為單位表示此距離。</p><p>(ii) 估算光從太陽行進至土星所需的時間，答案以秒為單位。</p><p>取光速 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 3.00 × 10<sup>8</sup> m s<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/dc1d3b3558b5c879bea3dcbb.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:410.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) (i) 43.2 分鐘</p><p>(ii) 43.2 光分 = 43.2 × (3.00 × 10<sup>8</sup>) × 60</p><p>= 7.78 × 10<sup>11</sup> m</p><p>(b) (i) 9.5 AU = 9.5 × 1.50 × 10<sup>11</sup> m</p><p>= 1.425 × 10<sup>12</sup> m ≈ 1.43 × 10<sup>12</sup> m</p><p>(ii) 所需時間 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.425</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3.00</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.425 \\times  10^{12}}{3.00 \\times  10^{8}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 4750 s</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E101_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3087b49bdd79ea7c2dc406fc17106daea52718390c47ec7fc614baf1dd248bf5","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,166.2848951171875,562.4491,535.1300964355469],"text":"例 題 1 行星與太陽的距離\r\n木星和土星這兩顆行星體積都很大，它們主要由氣體組成。\r\n9.5 AU\r\n43.2 光分\r\n太陽\r\n木星\r\n土星\r\n(a) 光分是另一個長度單位，一光分指光在真空行進一分鐘的距離。\r\n木星距離太陽約 43.2 光分。\r\n (i) 光從太陽行進到至木星需時多久？\r\n (ii) 試用米為單位表示太陽與木星之間的距離。\r\n(b) 太陽和土星相距約 9.5 AU。\r\n (i) 試用米為單位表示此距離。\r\n (ii) 估算光從太陽行進至土星所需的時間，答案以秒為單位。\r\n取光速 c = 3.00 × 108\r\n m s–1。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,535.1300964355469,562.4491,729.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) (i) 43.2 分鐘\r\n (ii) 43.2 光分 = 43.2 × (3.00 × 108\r\n) × 60 \r\n = 7.78 × 1011 m\r\n(b) (i) 9.5 AU = 9.5 × 1.50 × 1011 m \r\n = 1.425 × 1012 m \r\n ≈ 1.43 × 1012 m\r\n (ii) 所需時間 = 1.425 × 1012\r\n3.00 × 108 = 4750 s\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E101-2":{"id":"ex-E101-2","chapter":"E101","number":2,"title":"金星在軌道上的位置","question":"<p>以下幾幅金星的照片拍攝於某期間的不同日子（圖 a）。</p><p>圖 a</p><p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>、 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是金星軌道上的三點 <sup>X</sup> （圖 b）。判斷金星圍繞太陽運行的方 <sup>金星的軌道</sup> 太陽向。</p><p>Y</p><p>(b) 觀察到金星的新相時，它正處於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 還是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span>？試解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/d21aa2913f3465a815f10eb2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:532.1px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/16ef4a5360863b38edc922e0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:210.8px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> ➔ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> ➔ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>就如太陽在金星的一側，觀察者正處於金星的另一側。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E101_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"3087b49bdd79ea7c2dc406fc17106daea52718390c47ec7fc614baf1dd248bf5","segments":[{"page":32,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.499995117187495,557.4491,381.11077880859375],"text":"例 題 2 金星在軌道上的位置\r\n以下幾幅金星的照片拍攝於某期間的不同日子（圖 a）。\r\n圖 a\r\n新相\r\n(a) X、Y 和 Z 是金星軌道上的三點\r\n（圖 b）。判斷金星圍繞太陽運行的方\r\n向。\r\n(b) 觀察到金星的新相時，它正處於 X、Y\r\n還是 Z？試解釋。\r\n"},{"page":32,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,381.11077880859375,557.4491,488.6479951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) X ➔ Y ➔ Z\r\n(b) Z。\r\n就如太陽在金星的一側，觀察者正處於金星的另一側。\r\nX\r\nY\r\nZ\r\n太陽\r\n金星的軌道\r\n觀察者\r\n圖 b\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}